                                        "entry_id": "bd5a1ccf-a9d0-3443-9395-37959a28557b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A pitted, now usually metal, cup-shaped cap worn on the tip of a finger, which is used in sewing to push the needle through material."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "88832906-efca-4623-9462-b4a3a03134d8",
                                                "sense_id": "b5fe36cd-d052-3c08-9d0f-1064f8180ab0",
                                                "text": "She had worn a hole through her silver thimble, and wanted Owen to repair it."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6b18908c-84b5-3373-9ea6-64bce64bde87",
                                        "entry_id": "bd5a1ccf-a9d0-3443-9395-37959a28557b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "As much as fills a thimble (sense 1); a thimbleful."
